<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 382)</h2>
<p><b>Asobi Review — the client edition — exists.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>A separate distributable, "Asobi Review", ships alongside the full app: the same binary, permanently pinned to reviewer tiers. It opens in Basic mode (playback, comments, markup, session looks), an invite from you selects Basic or Expert, and it can never expose hosting, conform, tracker, or pipeline surfaces — signing out returns it to Basic, not to the full app.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
